  "difficulty_level": "H2",
  "difficulty_reason": "The proof must construct the unique prefix-compatible rise minimum and descent maximum for the author-specific movable-block order, including the full nested/overlapping slide cases at native1560–1691 and1742–1808. These constructions then preserve the entire common-lower-set while strictly increasing the shared prefix, yielding the meet by termination at1834–1864. No named external lattice theorem supplies this new local order mechanism; the single meet-semilattice outcome is proposed as H2.",
